{"ticker":"OKTA","updated":"2026-10-30T23:03:41Z","profile":{"longName":"Okta, Inc.","shortName":"Okta, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.okta.com","fullTimeEmployees":6366,"marketCap":36404711424,"trailingPE":125.445786,"forwardPE":47.56238,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":11.846636,"pegRatio":1.59,"targetMeanPrice":214.7165,"targetHighPrice":250.0,"targetLowPrice":127.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":43,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.106,"earningsGrowth":0.757,"grossMargins":0.78132004,"operatingMargins":0.13292,"profitMargins":0.09632,"totalRevenue":3072999936,"beta":0.733,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":235.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":62.66,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Okta, Inc. operates as an identity partner in the United States and internationally. It offers Single Sign-on to secure access to cloud and on-premises applications from any device; Adaptive MFA for a risk-based layer of security for an organization's cloud, mobile, and web applications; API Access Management, which enables organizations to secure APIs as systems; Access Gateway, which extends the Okta platform to hybrid IT environments; Okta Device Access, which extends Okta platform's secure access management to the device login experience; Universal Directory for a cloud-based system of record. The company also provides Identity Threat Protection; Identity Security Posture Management for security measures and safeguards digital assets; Okta for AI Agents to discover, register, authenticate, govern, and manage AI Agents; Identity Governance and Administration products, including Lifecycle Management, Okta Workflows, Okta Identity Governance, and Cross App Access; Advanced Server Access for continuous and contextual access management to secure cloud infrastructure; and Okta Privileged Access to reduce risk with unified access and governance management. In addition, it provides Universal Login, a standards-based login infrastructure; Attack Protection Suite to minimize risks associated with identity-targeted attacks; Adaptive MFA; Passwordless, which enables users to login with","summary_zh":"Okta, Inc. 在美國和國際上作為身分合作夥伴運作。它提供單一登入功能，可從任何裝置安全地存取雲端和本機應用程式；自適應 MFA，為組織的雲端、行動和 Web 應用程式提供基於風險的安全層； API 存取管理，使組織能夠保護 API 作為系統的安全性；Access Gateway，將 Okta 平台擴展到混合 IT 環境； Okta Device Access，將存取資料該公司還提供身分威脅防護；身分安全態勢管理，用於安全措施和保護數位資產； Okta 讓 AI 代理髮現、註冊、驗證、治理和管理 AI 代理；身份治理和管理產品，包括生命週期管理、Okta 工作流程、Okta 身份治理和跨應用程式訪問；高級伺服器訪問，用於連續和上下文存取管理，以保護基礎設施管理此外，它還提供通用登入（Universal Login），這是一種基於標準的登入基礎設施；攻擊防護套件可最大限度地降低與針對身分的攻擊相關的風險；自適應 MFA；無密碼，允許使用者登入","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":91.185,"h":91.64,"l":88.46,"c":89.5,"v":5111700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":89.59,"h":90.25,"l":88.17,"c":89.82,"v":3446000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":89.38,"h":90.85,"l":88.28,"c":89.74,"v":2904500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":90.29,"h":91.95,"l":90.03,"c":91.48,"v":3279800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":91.17,"h":92.73,"l":90.81,"c":92.68,"v":2351100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":92.31,"h":93.95,"l":91.881,"c":93.85,"v":3059200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":93.97,"h":94.34,"l":89.65,"c":90.21,"v":2899100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":90.78,"h":92.14,"l":89.78,"c":91.96,"v":2193700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":91.96,"h":92.47,"l":90.25,"c":90.34,"v":1810700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":90.8,"h":91.806,"l":89.92,"c":90.91,"v":1700400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":90.86,"h":91.0,"l":89.29,"c":89.92,"v":2287800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":90.13,"h":91.728,"l":88.9,"c":90.0,"v":2569600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":90.94,"h":94.0,"l":90.6,"c":93.6,"v":3154100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":94.0,"h":94.15,"l":92.02,"c":93.37,"v":5822800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":92.6,"h":94.35,"l":91.4,"c":92.38,"v":2522900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":92.4,"h":94.2,"l":91.87,"c":92.2,"v":2157100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":92.3,"h":93.8,"l":89.82,"c":89.87,"v":3193800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":89.46,"h":91.45,"l":88.899,"c":91.19,"v":2796900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":90.