X2E0ZVJKVno4aDBsTG5mcmh1SmMyTjdjMnQ0eElJSXh6MU9BaDVKMFZBNUxlUmNoS1lsbg?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Okta 今年迄今飆升 158%：投資者現在應該持有該股票嗎？"},{"title":"Can Okta's Agent Identity Platform Capture the AI Security Opportunity?","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNM2VQbVI5bE80cDRDemhMUElyYmFGWWcxd0wwbkZ3MGFtNUhZTXZCUnFJUXZaNGJsVXdMSVVqTFowQVpRZ185NGlEdXNUUVhhX2tSaVNHQktXWDExWmZRaV9KbFYwZ09EcW40TGRLaElLdE9VY1Z4Wk1BTHdkWXFLOFl1Q2lzcTVqT18yRk9fb2VvNnFISk44Z3ZFeFFBeFN5dHp6cmlaUXA3Q2wzeXc3QUZNbDBqeGV4aEdvbm5JZHgwVEdu?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Okta 的代理身份平台能否抓住人工智慧安全機會？"},{"title":"Hackers Cite Okta in 41,000-Staff DHS Leak [2026] - https://tech-insider.org/","src":"https://tech-insider.org/","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOMVliUENVeGlBZlVzQ3p1R1l5MEhfblJkMzljZnI0d1Zvd29vMHdWTjIwWnQtZk5kQmtUelJOYTlranQ4VWZLNlEzYThlRnNOX1lKUVJkU3hYbHN3VGRITVh3QVFFQ18zNUlJZ3ZiTnViXy1jY291MTZZQnowelBvMHM1T0Y4Zmh4?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"駭客在 41,000 名員工的 DHS 洩漏事件中引用了 Okta [2026] - https://tech-insider.org/"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-05","period":"2026-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1660134/000166013426000020/okta-20260131.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are the leading independent identity partner. Our vision is to free everyone to safely use any technology, and we believe identity is the key to making that happen. Our purpose is to bring simple and secure digital access to people and organizations everywhere. Our Okta Platform and Auth0 Platform enable our customers to securely connect the right people to the right technologies and services at the right time.","zh":"我们是领先的独立身份合作伙伴。我们的愿景是让每个人都能安全地使用任何技术，我们相信身份是实现这一目标的关键。我们的目标是为世界各地的人们和组织提供简单、安全的数字访问。我們的 Okta 平台和 Auth0 平台使我們的客戶能夠在正確的時間安全地將正確的人員連接到正確的技術和服務。"},{"en":"Identity is becoming the most critical layer of an organization's security. The acceleration of digital transformation, cloud adoption and the evolving security threat landscape continue to drive a shift in how organizations securely manage the identity of their employees, contractors and partners. As organizations shift from network-based security models to a Zero Trust security model focused on adaptive and context-aware controls, identity has become the most reliable way to manage user access and protect digital assets.","zh":"身分認同正成為組織安全最關鍵的一層。數位轉型的加速、雲端的採用和不斷變化的安全威脅情勢持續推動組織安全管理員工、承包商和合作夥伴身分的方式轉變。隨著組織從基於網路的安全模型轉向專注於自適應和上下文感知控制的零信任安全模型，身分已成為管理使用者存取和保護數位資產的最可靠方式。"},{"en":"In addition to these established drivers, the emergence of artificial intelligence (\"AI\") and the deployment of AI agents may, over time, create new opportunities for identity management. We see a potential long-term opportunity for our platforms to serve as a unified, independent control plane for non-human identities (\"NHIs\") and AI agents, a distinct class of identity that requires authenticated, secure access to sensitive resources at a scale and speed exceeding traditional security models designed for human users. While adoption is in its early stages, we believe the inherent challenges of governing NHIs and agentic identities may drive increased demand for our solutions as these technologies and customer adoption continue to mature.","zh":"除了這些既定的驅動因素之外，隨著時間的推移，人工智慧（「AI」）的出現和人工智慧代理的部署可能會為身分管理創造新的機會。我們看到我們的平台有一個潛在的長期機會，可以作為非人類身份（“NHIs”）和人工智慧代理的統一、獨立的控制平面，這是一種獨特的身份類別，需要經過身份驗證、安全地訪問敏感資源，其規模和速度超過為人類用戶設計的傳統安全模型。雖然採用尚處於早期階段，但我們相信，隨著這些技術和客戶採用的不斷成熟，治理 NHI 和代理身分的固有挑戰可能會推動對我們解決方案的需求增加。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"As of January 31, 2026, we had more than 20,000 customers, including 5,100 customers with an annual contract value greater than $100,000. Our customers span nearly all industry verticals and range from small organizations with fewer than 100 employees to companies in the Fortune 50, with up to hundreds of thousands of employees, some of which use our platforms to manage millions of their customers' identities.","zh":"截至2026年1月31日，我们拥有超过20,000名客户，其中年合同价值超过10万美元的客户有5,100名。我們的客戶幾乎涵蓋所有垂直行業，從員工不到 100 名的小型組織到擁有數十萬名員工的財富 50 強公司，其中一些公司使用我們的平台來管理數百萬客戶的身份。"},{"en":"We sell directly to customers through our direct inside and field sales force and also indirectly through our extensive ecosystem of channel partners. We also offer a self-service approach for developers to sign up for free trials, free plans, paid developer plans of our Auth0 Platform, which may transition to paid enterprise plans that include more fulsome offerings. We often leverage our expansion sales model to generate incremental revenue, often within the term of the initial agreement, through the addition of new users and the sale of additional product offerings. In many instances, we find that initial customer success with our platforms results in key internal decision-makers expanding their deployments, for example, from workforce identity to customer identity needs, or vice-versa. Furthermore, as our customers are successful in their businesses and increase headcount, the number","zh":"我們透過直接的內部和現場銷售人員直接向客戶銷售，也透過我們廣泛的通路合作夥伴生態系統間接向客戶銷售。我們還為開發人員提供自助服務方法，用於註冊 Auth0 平台的免費試用、免費計劃、付費開發人員計劃，這些計劃可能會過渡到包含更豐富產品的付費企業計劃。我們經常利用我們的擴張銷售模式來產生增量收入，通常是在初始協議的期限內，透過增加新用戶和銷售以外的產品來產生增量收入。在許多情況下，我們發現，客戶使用我們的平台取得的初步成功會導致關鍵內部決策者擴大其部署，例如從員工身分到客戶身分需求，反之亦然。此外，随着我​​们的客户在业务上取得成功并增加员工人数，"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Subscription & Circulation","val":2855000000,"zh":"認購及流通"},{"name":"Technology Service","val":64000000,"zh":"技術服務"}],"total":2919000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":2321000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":598000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":2919000000}},"peers":["ZS","TWLO","DDOG","CRWD","DOCU"]}}